","/cdn/init/1022200_Skill_11200170_Icon.png","暗爪","對目標發動暗元素連續爪擊，造成傷害。",{"attributes":213,"type":215,"consume":192,"power":216},[214],"12",[191],"52",{"id":218,"type":131,"props":219},"91268505_38",{"id":220,"customKey":46,"icon":221,"iconStyle":63,"iconTitle":46,"descTitle":222,"descContent":223,"source":224},"91268505_39","/cdn/init/1022200_Skill_10400200_Icon.png","雷爪","駕馭閃電之力，對目標發動三連爪擊，技能額外附加50%暴擊率。",{"attributes":225,"type":226,"consume":192,"power":192},[189],[191],{"id":228,"title":229,"children":230},"91268505_40","固有技能",[231,243],{"id":232,"type":131,"props":233},"91268505_41",{"id":234,"customKey":46,"icon":235,"iconStyle":63,"iconTitle":46,"descTitle":236,"descContent":237,"source":238},"91268505_42","/cdn/init/1022200_Skill_10400000_Icon.png","攻擊","使用電元素能力，近距離攻擊目標。",{"attributes":239,"type":240,"consume":241,"power":242},[189],[191],"0","6",{"id":244,"type":131,"props":245},"91268505_43",{"id":246,"customKey":46,"icon":247,"iconStyle":63,"iconTitle":46,"descTitle":248,"descContent":249,"source":250},"91268505_44","/cdn/init/1022200_Skill_10400220_Icon.png","電光石火","極速躍起匯聚電流向下砸落攻擊目標，並進入「激電狀態」。",{"attributes":251,"type":252,"consume":241,"power":253},[189],[191],"135",[255,256,257,259],{"id":4,"entryId":12,"currentMorphology":21,"visible":15},{"id":6,"entryId":12,"currentMorphology":13,"visible":15},{"id":258,"entryId":12,"currentMorphology":9,"visible":15},"10003451",{"id":260,"entryId":12,"currentMorphology":261,"visible":15},"10003544","Umbrabow Form",[263,275,286,296,307,317,327,339,349,359,369,380,390,402,412,423,434,444,454,464,474,484,494,505,515,525,535,545,555,565,575,585,595,605,615,625,635,645,655,665,675,685,695,705,715,725,735,743,747,757,767,777,787,797,807,817,827,837,847,857,867,877,887,897,907,917,927,937,947,957,967,977,987,997,1007,1017,1027,1037,1047,1057,1067,1077,1087,1097,1107,1117,1127,1137,1147,1157,1167,1177,1187,1198],{"id":264,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":265,"visible":15},"10003442",{"type":10,"entryId":266,"sortOrder":267,"name":268,"imageUrl":269,"description":270,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":271,"attributes":273},"001",1005100,"小炭狗","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10051.png","活潑好動且總愛跟在焚火狼後頭。蓬鬆炭毛中夾雜著隱燃星火，當火光匯聚燃燒之時，便是牠成長之日。",[272],"position-dps",[274],"attributes-fire",{"id":276,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":277,"visible":15},"10003534",{"type":10,"entryId":278,"sortOrder":279,"name":280,"imageUrl":281,"description":282,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":283,"position":284,"attributes":285},"002",1005200,"焚火狼","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10052.png","習慣成群結隊活動，極度重視忠誠與團結，冷靜專注的眼神下隱藏著如烈焰般熾熱的心。","2",[272],[274],{"id":287,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":288,"visible":15},"10003435",{"type":10,"entryId":289,"sortOrder":290,"name":291,"imageUrl":292,"description":293,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":294,"attributes":295},"003",1005300,"狼鬥士","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10053.png","性格好勝，面對越強大的對手越是熱血沸騰。烈火與焦炭將化為印記，見證牠不斷變強的歷程。",[272],[274],{"id":297,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":298,"visible":15},"10003428",{"type":10,"entryId":299,"sortOrder":300,"name":301,"imageUrl":302,"description":303,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":304,"attributes":305},"004",1005500,"獄魂狼","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10055.png","挑戰強者落敗的焚火狼，吸收了同樣懷恨倒下的同伴靈魂，以復仇的欲望驅使自身行動。",[24],[274,306],"attributes-dark",{"id":308,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":309,"visible":15},"10003578",{"type":10,"entryId":310,"sortOrder":311,"name":312,"imageUrl":313,"description":314,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":315,"attributes":316},"005",1001100,"星樂蒂","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10011.png","在林間飛行尋找食物時，頭上的發光星星常被誤認作流星。超級貪吃，有囤積食物的習慣，也會用食物來裝飾自己的小窩。",[272],[306],{"id":318,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":319,"visible":15},"10003417",{"type":10,"entryId":320,"sortOrder":321,"name":322,"imageUrl":323,"description":324,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":325,"attributes":326},"006",1001200,"星法師","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10012.png","獨來獨往，常穿梭在夜色之中。外型如同身披星空斗篷的神祕魔法師，能夠使用精神能量進行瞬移。",[272],[306],{"id":328,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":329,"visible":15},"10003488",{"type":10,"entryId":330,"sortOrder":331,"name":332,"imageUrl":333,"description":334,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":335,"attributes":337},"007",1018100,"口哨鷗","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10181.png","常盤旋於低空並時刻注意沙灘動靜。喜歡湊熱鬧並發出清脆口哨聲起哄。",[336],"position-sup",[338],"attributes-wind",{"id":340,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":341,"visible":15},"10003548",{"type":10,"entryId":342,"sortOrder":343,"name":344,"imageUrl":345,"description":346,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":347,"attributes":348},"008",1018400,"長號鷗","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10184.png","生性熱鬧且能奏出充滿節奏感的樂聲，常按捺不住內心衝動，加入同伴間的即興合奏。",[336],[338],{"id":350,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":351,"visible":15},"10003474",{"type":10,"entryId":352,"sortOrder":353,"name":354,"imageUrl":355,"description":356,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":357,"attributes":358},"009",1018500,"小號鷗","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10185.png","能發出響徹海灘的嘹亮尖叫，愛出風頭的牠並不在意製造噪音。為了耳朵健康，最好別惹怒牠。",[272],[338],{"id":360,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":361,"visible":15},"10003467",{"type":10,"entryId":362,"sortOrder":363,"name":364,"imageUrl":365,"description":366,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":367,"attributes":368},"010",1018700,"大號鷗","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10187.png","能發出低沉的大號音色。性格如音色般厚重沉穩且待人友善，風暴降臨海岸時，待在牠身邊總能感到安心。",[24],[338],{"id":370,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":371,"visible":15},"10003392",{"type":10,"entryId":372,"sortOrder":373,"name":374,"imageUrl":375,"description":376,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":377,"attributes":378},"011",1021100,"飄飄花","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10211.png","飄飄花的身軀極其輕盈，常乘風飄起並藉由花瓣裙的阻力緩緩旋轉降落，或是乾脆隨風四處旅行。",[272],[379],"attributes-grass",{"id":381,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":382,"visible":15},"10003510",{"type":10,"entryId":383,"sortOrder":384,"name":385,"imageUrl":386,"description":387,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":388,"attributes":389},"012",1021200,"花舞蘭","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10212.png","沉浸於表演之中，最大目標是精進舞藝，期盼有朝一日讓所有生物都能感受舞蹈中的生命力。",[272],[379],{"id":391,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":392,"visible":15},"10003477",{"type":10,"entryId":393,"sortOrder":394,"name":395,"imageUrl":396,"description":397,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":398,"attributes":400},"014",1004100,"蓮頂魚","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10041.png","喜歡躲在水下探頭觀察新鮮事物。牠以為蓮葉帽是絕佳偽裝，卻不知在水面移動的蓮葉更引人注目。",[399],"position-heal",[401],"attributes-water",{"id":403,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":404,"visible":15},"10003569",{"type":10,"entryId":405,"sortOrder":406,"name":407,"imageUrl":408,"description":409,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":283,"position":410,"attributes":411},"015",1004200,"搗蛋魚","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10042.png","極度懼怕高溫，喜歡待在涼爽濕潤處。體表覆蓋著保濕降溫膜，觸感滑溜。若離開水太久，皮膚會乾裂。",[399],[401],{"id":413,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":414,"visible":15},"10003470",{"type":10,"entryId":415,"sortOrder":416,"name":417,"imageUrl":418,"description":419,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":420,"attributes":421},"016",1004300,"熒冰龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10043.png","外型與氣質皆極致優雅。天性善良且樂於照顧弱小，但若想利用這份善意傷害牠，將會被瞬間凍成冰塊。",[399],[401,422],"attributes-ice",{"id":424,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":425,"visible":15},"10003463",{"type":10,"entryId":426,"sortOrder":427,"name":428,"imageUrl":429,"description":430,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":431,"attributes":433},"017",1004500,"蓮冠龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10045.png","與蓮花為伴並棲身於蓮葉間，習慣以擬態蓮葉的尾部遮掩面容，展現出矜持且高雅的姿態。",[432],"position-energy",[379,401],{"id":435,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":436,"visible":15},"10003468",{"type":10,"entryId":437,"sortOrder":438,"name":439,"imageUrl":440,"description":441,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":442,"attributes":443},"018",1026100,"雲朵羊","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10261.png","喜歡在晴朗草原上成群活動，輕飄飄的身軀能懸停於雲霧中，三三兩兩擠作一團。",[336],[338],{"id":445,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":446,"visible":15},"10003365",{"type":10,"entryId":447,"sortOrder":448,"name":449,"imageUrl":450,"description":451,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":452,"attributes":453},"019",1026200,"蓬蓬羊","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10262.png","喜歡躲在雲團中睡覺，因風壓與靜電存在，蓬鬆羊毛極易吸附隨風飛過的小物。",[336],[338],{"id":455,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":456,"visible":15},"10003461",{"type":10,"entryId":457,"sortOrder":458,"name":459,"imageUrl":460,"description":461,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":462,"attributes":463},"020",1026300,"眠眠羊","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10263.png","吸收夢境能量的毛髮呈現出迷離幻彩。當牠將這團毛髮當作枕頭呼呼大睡時，便能沉入甜美夢鄉。",[336],[306],{"id":465,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":466,"visible":15},"10003421",{"type":10,"entryId":467,"sortOrder":468,"name":469,"imageUrl":470,"description":471,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":472,"attributes":473},"021",1020100,"跑調草","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10201.png","成群結隊生活在草原上，平時鑽入地底吸收養分。喜歡聚在一起唱歌，卻對自己的走音毫無自覺。",[24],[379],{"id":475,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":476,"visible":15},"10003414",{"type":10,"entryId":477,"sortOrder":478,"name":479,"imageUrl":480,"description":481,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":482,"attributes":483},"022",1020300,"女巫草","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10203.png","討厭闖入領地的生物，會發出古怪音波擾亂對手心智、降低防禦力，甚至能讓對方陷入昏迷。",[432],[306,379],{"id":485,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":486,"visible":15},"10003404",{"type":10,"entryId":487,"sortOrder":488,"name":489,"imageUrl":490,"description":491,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":492,"attributes":493},"023",1020700,"埋埋草","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10207.png","曾長時間埋入地底，重見天日時已變得巨大無比。需靠根系吸收土壤養分維持活力，極度厭惡離開土地。",[24],[379],{"id":495,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":496,"visible":15},"10003567",{"type":10,"entryId":497,"sortOrder":498,"name":499,"imageUrl":500,"description":501,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":502,"attributes":503},"024",1016100,"花芽蟹","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10161.png","一生只會選擇一名伴侶，對愛情極其專一且總是成雙成對活動。頭頂的蟹心草代表著牠的幸福程度。",[24],[504,379],"attributes-rock",{"id":506,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":507,"visible":15},"10003462",{"type":10,"entryId":508,"sortOrder":509,"name":510,"imageUrl":511,"description":512,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":513,"attributes":514},"025",1016200,"蔥蔥蟹","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10162.png","茂盛植株完全覆蓋背殼並透過吸收日光提供養分，在陽光充足時，不必額外進食就能生存。",[24],[504,379],{"id":516,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":517,"visible":15},"10003551",{"type":10,"entryId":518,"sortOrder":519,"name":520,"imageUrl":521,"description":522,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":523,"attributes":524},"026",1016300,"晶殼蟹","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10163.png","幽居於洞穴中且因食物含豐富礦物質，背殼逐漸被晶體覆蓋。平時藏身地下，以華麗背殼吸引獵物靠近。",[24],[422],{"id":526,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":527,"visible":15},"10003409",{"type":10,"entryId":528,"sortOrder":529,"name":530,"imageUrl":531,"description":532,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":533,"attributes":534},"027",1033100,"幽幽焰","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10331.png","外表雖如火焰，但那僅是能量流動的型態，不僅不發熱還會吸收周圍熱量。有時會以此偽裝成篝火戲弄他人。",[432],[274],{"id":536,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":537,"visible":15},"10003507",{"type":10,"entryId":538,"sortOrder":539,"name":540,"imageUrl":541,"description":542,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":543,"attributes":544},"028",1033300,"幻焰靈","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10333.png","僅在深夜現身，身軀由氣態能量構成，因此能隨意分裂，甚至具備製造分身的能力。",[432],[274],{"id":546,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":547,"visible":15},"10003542",{"type":10,"entryId":548,"sortOrder":549,"name":550,"imageUrl":551,"description":552,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":553,"attributes":554},"029",1023100,"螢粉蝶","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10231.png","膽小且警惕，察覺危險便會尋找藏身處，但抖落的螢光鱗粉卻總是暴露行蹤。",[399],[338],{"id":556,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":557,"visible":15},"10003440",{"type":10,"entryId":558,"sortOrder":559,"name":560,"imageUrl":561,"description":562,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":563,"attributes":564},"030",1023200,"幻翼蝶","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10232.png","個性冷淡且獨來獨往，察覺危險迫近時會搧動翅膀吹出鱗粉製造幻覺迷惑對手，隨後慢悠悠地離開。",[399],[338],{"id":566,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":567,"visible":15},"10003563",{"type":10,"entryId":568,"sortOrder":569,"name":570,"imageUrl":571,"description":572,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":241,"position":573,"attributes":574},"031",1023300,"幻夢蝶","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10233.png","蝶翼閃爍著絢麗光輝，揮動翅膀時灑落的鱗粉能促進花卉生長，使所到之處皆生機盎然。",[432],[338,379],{"id":576,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":577,"visible":15},"10003368",{"type":10,"entryId":578,"sortOrder":579,"name":580,"imageUrl":581,"description":582,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":583,"attributes":584},"032",1044100,"大耳蝠","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10441.png","大耳朵高高聳立且對聲音極其敏感，只要是牠追蹤的動靜，無論遠近都不會遺漏。",[336],[338],{"id":586,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":587,"visible":15},"10003363",{"type":10,"entryId":588,"sortOrder":589,"name":590,"imageUrl":591,"description":592,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":593,"attributes":594},"033",1044300,"偵探蝠","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10443.png","好奇心旺盛，熱衷於搜尋痕跡與追蹤目標，尾部圓環能放大超音波，輕鬆識破隱身把戲。",[336],[338],{"id":596,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":597,"visible":15},"10003515",{"type":10,"entryId":598,"sortOrder":599,"name":600,"imageUrl":601,"description":602,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":603,"attributes":604},"034",1032100,"小哭苞","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10321.png","膽小且怕痛，稍有動靜就掉眼淚，但被逼急時也會揮舞棘刺反抗。當真正勇敢時，頭頂花苞便會綻放。",[272],[379],{"id":606,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":607,"visible":15},"10003496",{"type":10,"entryId":608,"sortOrder":609,"name":610,"imageUrl":611,"description":612,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":613,"attributes":614},"035",1032300,"刺劍玫","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10323.png","刺莖化成的長劍平時收納於手臂葉片中，唯有戰鬥時才會抽出。性格無畏且不懼挑戰，盡心盡力守護著族群。",[272],[379],{"id":616,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":617,"visible":15},"10003378",{"type":10,"entryId":618,"sortOrder":619,"name":620,"imageUrl":621,"description":622,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":623,"attributes":624},"036",1032400,"魅樂薇","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10324.png","為平息紛爭，它會散落馨香花瓣，令接觸者心生幸福感，進而使戰意消散。",[336],[379],{"id":626,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":627,"visible":15},"10003456",{"type":10,"entryId":628,"sortOrder":629,"name":630,"imageUrl":631,"description":632,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":633,"attributes":634},"037",1047100,"河童蛋","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10471.png","休息時縮入殼中，有時會被誤認為伊莫蛋。害怕戰鬥卻愛湊熱鬧，喜歡揮舞草球跳舞助威。",[24],[379],{"id":636,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":637,"visible":15},"10003374",{"type":10,"entryId":638,"sortOrder":639,"name":640,"imageUrl":641,"description":642,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":643,"attributes":644},"038",1047400,"霹靂蜥","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10474.png","四肢靈活的牠見誰都想炫耀華麗踢技，喜歡將蛻下的皮像兜帽一樣帥氣地套在頭上。",[336],[26],{"id":646,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":647,"visible":15},"10003443",{"type":10,"entryId":648,"sortOrder":649,"name":650,"imageUrl":651,"description":652,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":653,"attributes":654},"039",1047500,"咆尾蜥","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10475.png","高聳鬣毛盡顯狂放，野性咆哮張揚本色。尾部構造能收納聲波，撞擊對手時會施放音爆攻擊。",[24],[379],{"id":656,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":657,"visible":15},"10003503",{"type":10,"entryId":658,"sortOrder":659,"name":660,"imageUrl":661,"description":662,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":663,"attributes":664},"040",1035100,"採蜜鳥","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10351.png","將採集的花蜜儲存於體內發酵，吐出後可作為香水原料，是調香師們不可或缺的合作夥伴。",[336],[306],{"id":666,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":667,"visible":15},"10003521",{"type":10,"entryId":668,"sortOrder":669,"name":670,"imageUrl":671,"description":672,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":673,"attributes":674},"041",1035200,"香氛鳥","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10352.png","對氣味極其挑剔，會取食不同花蜜儲存於體內，調配專屬香水原料，全身羽毛皆浸透著獨特香氣。",[336],[306],{"id":676,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":677,"visible":15},"10003508",{"type":10,"entryId":678,"sortOrder":679,"name":680,"imageUrl":681,"description":682,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":683,"attributes":684},"042",1003100,"幽爪鐮","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10031.png","戰勝同伴是進化的唯一途徑。為了應對隨時出現的對手，牠隨時都在尋找合適的石頭磨利爪子。",[272],[306],{"id":686,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":687,"visible":15},"10003369",{"type":10,"entryId":688,"sortOrder":689,"name":690,"imageUrl":691,"description":692,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":693,"attributes":694},"043",1003200,"淬刃螂","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10032.png","磨礪利刃並靜待時機，在暗影中以匿蹤之姿戲弄對手，是名追求一擊必殺的冷酷刺客。",[272],[306],{"id":696,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":697,"visible":15},"10003501",{"type":10,"entryId":698,"sortOrder":699,"name":700,"imageUrl":701,"description":702,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":703,"attributes":704},"044",1003300,"電刺螂","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10033.png","前肢折斷的幽爪鐮吸收雷電之力進化而來，重塑後的逆刃鋒利無比，閃爍著耀眼的電光。",[272],[26],{"id":706,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":707,"visible":15},"10003422",{"type":10,"entryId":708,"sortOrder":709,"name":710,"imageUrl":711,"description":712,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":713,"attributes":714},"045",1013100,"冰骨狼","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10131.png","長著一對大耳朵的元氣狼仔，胸前的冰骨領結是牠最愛的玩具。最討厭行事沒有邊界的小炭狗。",[272],[422],{"id":716,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":717,"visible":15},"10003575",{"type":10,"entryId":718,"sortOrder":719,"name":720,"imageUrl":721,"description":722,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":283,"position":723,"attributes":724},"046",1013200,"冰刃狼","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10132.png","唯恐喪失鬥志而極度反感被撫摸，跟隨族群捕獵時總是咬著冰刀衝在最前線，渴望成為獨當一面的戰士。",[272],[422],{"id":726,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":727,"visible":15},"10003415",{"type":10,"entryId":728,"sortOrder":729,"name":730,"imageUrl":731,"description":732,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":733,"attributes":734},"047",1013300,"霜鋒狼","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10133.png","對實力充滿絕對自信的高傲戰士，口中冰刃散發著凜冽寒氣，唯有面對強敵時才會感到興奮。",[272],[422],{"id":736,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":737,"visible":15},"10003524",{"type":10,"entryId":8,"sortOrder":738,"name":73,"imageUrl":739,"description":740,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":741,"attributes":742},1022100,"/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10221.png","生活在樹林間，攻擊時尾巴會冒出金色電光與劈啪作響的電流聲。動作靈巧敏捷，極難捕捉。",[24],[26],{"id":4,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":744,"visible":15},{"type":10,"entryId":12,"sortOrder":17,"name":18,"imageUrl":19,"description":20,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":745,"attributes":746},[24],[26],{"id":748,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":749,"visible":15},"10003523",{"type":10,"entryId":750,"sortOrder":751,"name":752,"imageUrl":753,"description":754,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":755,"attributes":756},"050",1017100,"羞羞獺","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10171.png","會四處挖掘尋找求愛禮物，卻因太容易害羞而常告白失敗。用小爪子搓揉臉頰是牠的標誌性動作。",[24],[401],{"id":758,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":759,"visible":15},"10003398",{"type":10,"entryId":760,"sortOrder":761,"name":762,"imageUrl":763,"description":764,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":283,"position":765,"attributes":766},"051",1017200,"泡泡獺","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10172.png","會精心挑選貝殼並製作與身形相配的新鏟子。據說遇到心動對象時，身邊會浮現粉紅色的泡泡。",[24],[401],{"id":768,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":769,"visible":15},"10003516",{"type":10,"entryId":770,"sortOrder":771,"name":772,"imageUrl":773,"description":774,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":775,"attributes":776},"052",1017300,"漂漂獺","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10173.png","生性自戀且每天花大量時間梳理毛髮。精心計算出水姿態並享受被追隨的感覺，發達肌肉卻因毛髮濃密而無法炫耀。",[336],[401],{"id":778,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":779,"visible":15},"10003566",{"type":10,"entryId":780,"sortOrder":781,"name":782,"imageUrl":783,"description":784,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":785,"attributes":786},"053",1017400,"胖胖獺","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10174.png","強壯身軀能爆發出驚人力量，但比起炫耀武力更喜歡宅在巢穴，並蒐集各式裝飾物來裝點家園。",[24],[401],{"id":788,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":789,"visible":15},"10003453",{"type":10,"entryId":790,"sortOrder":791,"name":792,"imageUrl":793,"description":794,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":795,"attributes":796},"054",1019100,"貝殼星","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10191.png","用柔軟腕足吸附貝殼包裹自身，混跡在沙灘的普通貝殼堆中，平時緊閉甲殼，僅在夜晚打開沐浴月光。",[272],[401],{"id":798,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":799,"visible":15},"10003577",{"type":10,"entryId":800,"sortOrder":801,"name":802,"imageUrl":803,"description":804,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":283,"position":805,"attributes":806},"055",1019200,"智多星","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10192.png","嚮往著璀璨星空，常躺在背殼上搖晃身體，閉上雙眼沉浸於星辰編織的夢境之中。",[272],[401],{"id":808,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":809,"visible":15},"10003570",{"type":10,"entryId":810,"sortOrder":811,"name":812,"imageUrl":813,"description":814,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":815,"attributes":816},"056",1019400,"星騎士","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10194.png","將曾包裹自身的貝殼化作劍與盾，當脆弱的貝殼星遇險時會挺身而出。喜歡沿海岸線逐浪而行。",[272],[401],{"id":818,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":819,"visible":15},"10003565",{"type":10,"entryId":820,"sortOrder":821,"name":822,"imageUrl":823,"description":824,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":825,"attributes":826},"057",1045100,"滾滾郎","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10451.png","從出生起就與石球形影不離，透過不斷滾動讓球體越來越圓，但牠推著的石球似乎不像表面上那麼簡單。",[272],[504],{"id":828,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":829,"visible":15},"10003476",{"type":10,"entryId":830,"sortOrder":831,"name":832,"imageUrl":833,"description":834,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":835,"attributes":836},"058",1045300,"機車郎","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10453.png","像以前一樣倒著前進，因完全掌控了滾球技巧，能做出各種高難度動作攻擊目標。",[272],[504],{"id":838,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":839,"visible":15},"10003466",{"type":10,"entryId":840,"sortOrder":841,"name":842,"imageUrl":843,"description":844,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":845,"attributes":846},"059",1045400,"岩球郎","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10454.png","與滾滾郎朝夕相伴的石球因顛簸而覺醒，厭倦了身不由己的它吞噬蟲體後，終於能憑藉自身意志進行活動。",[336],[504],{"id":848,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":849,"visible":15},"10003379",{"type":10,"entryId":850,"sortOrder":851,"name":852,"imageUrl":853,"description":854,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":855,"attributes":856},"060",1029100,"天使茸","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10291.png","總是掛著招牌笑容，熱情邀請其他伊莫一同玩耍。雖偶爾因頑皮或嘴饞惹出麻煩，但總能獲得原諒。",[272],[26],{"id":858,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":859,"visible":15},"10003376",{"type":10,"entryId":860,"sortOrder":861,"name":862,"imageUrl":863,"description":864,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":865,"attributes":866},"061",1029300,"疾電茸","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10293.png","憑藉毛髮優異的導電性能，凝集雷光之力延伸出雙翼，以疾馳之姿驅散陰霾，讓心情也隨之轉晴。",[272],[26],{"id":868,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":869,"visible":15},"10003543",{"type":10,"entryId":870,"sortOrder":871,"name":872,"imageUrl":873,"description":874,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":875,"attributes":876},"062",1002100,"大眼盔","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10021.png","堅硬的頭盔保護柔軟的身體，能從口中伸出勾爪掠食，富有彈性的身體能裝下自身十倍體積的食物。",[24],[306],{"id":878,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":879,"visible":15},"10003557",{"type":10,"entryId":880,"sortOrder":881,"name":882,"imageUrl":883,"description":884,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":885,"attributes":886},"063",1002600,"盔勇士","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10026.png","獲得斷劍與盔甲並傳承了勇氣與力量，終於成為一名能守護同伴、直面強敵的勇士。",[272],[306],{"id":888,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":889,"visible":15},"10003522",{"type":10,"entryId":890,"sortOrder":891,"name":892,"imageUrl":893,"description":894,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":895,"attributes":896},"064",1002700,"盔衛士","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10027.png","身材高大卻性格膽小，遇到危險就縮成球逃避戰鬥，但為了守護同伴，牠也能鼓起勇氣應戰。",[24],[306],{"id":898,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":899,"visible":15},"10003579",{"type":10,"entryId":900,"sortOrder":901,"name":902,"imageUrl":903,"description":904,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":905,"attributes":906},"065",1002400,"鋼顎仔","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10024.png","路過什麼都想啃一口。下巴活動性極佳，張開角度驚人。牠習慣以輕咬表達喜悅，尤其偏愛金屬製品，因為不容易咬壞。",[24],[338],{"id":908,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":909,"visible":15},"10003389",{"type":10,"entryId":910,"sortOrder":911,"name":912,"imageUrl":913,"description":914,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":283,"position":915,"attributes":916},"066",1002200,"盔面龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10022.png","幼龍將脆弱隱藏於頭盔之下，內心渴望變得更強並自由翱翔，前往世界各個角落尋找隱匿的寶藏。",[24],[338],{"id":918,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":919,"visible":15},"10003536",{"type":10,"entryId":920,"sortOrder":921,"name":922,"imageUrl":923,"description":924,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":925,"attributes":926},"067",1002300,"銀盔龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10023.png","全身覆蓋著堅硬鎧甲，停駐於石台時宛如高大的雕像。傳說牠會守在遺跡入口，看守古老的寶藏。",[24],[338],{"id":928,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":929,"visible":15},"10003529",{"type":10,"entryId":930,"sortOrder":931,"name":932,"imageUrl":933,"description":934,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":935,"attributes":936},"068",1002500,"炎鎧龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10025.png","身披烈焰淬煉後的金屬重鎧，暴怒噴發的火焰能瞬間將周遭化為熔岩。不想化為灰燼就離牠遠點。",[272],[274],{"id":938,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":939,"visible":15},"10003433",{"type":10,"entryId":940,"sortOrder":941,"name":942,"imageUrl":943,"description":944,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":945,"attributes":946},"069",1050100,"迷夢仔","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10501.png","白天處於夢遊狀態，若被吵醒會瞬間暴躁失控，一旦體力耗盡便會乖乖墜入夢鄉。",[272],[504],{"id":948,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":949,"visible":15},"10003427",{"type":10,"entryId":950,"sortOrder":951,"name":952,"imageUrl":953,"description":954,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":955,"attributes":956},"070",1050300,"暴睡熊","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10503.png","在平日的溫柔之下，是時刻的隱忍與克制，但若受刺激或腹中空空時，便會無法自控並陷入狂暴之中。",[272],[504],{"id":958,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":959,"visible":15},"10003405",{"type":10,"entryId":960,"sortOrder":961,"name":962,"imageUrl":963,"description":964,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":965,"attributes":966},"071",1028100,"碎岩仔","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10281.png","天生具備感應礦石的能力，偏好進食各種礦石，且攝取的礦石種類會直接影響其成長方向。",[24],[504],{"id":968,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":969,"visible":15},"10003525",{"type":10,"entryId":970,"sortOrder":971,"name":972,"imageUrl":973,"description":974,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":283,"position":975,"attributes":976},"072",1028200,"熾岩龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10282.png","以堅硬利爪擊碎晶石後吞服以儲存熱量，體表也因此顯現火紅紋路。體型雖小巧，卻能從口中持續噴出高熱焰流。",[24],[274,504],{"id":978,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":979,"visible":15},"10003399",{"type":10,"entryId":980,"sortOrder":981,"name":982,"imageUrl":983,"description":984,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":985,"attributes":986},"073",1028300,"熔暴龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10283.png","熾熱晶體如凝結的熔岩般於身軀生長，其積存的熱量若瞬間爆發，足以熔毀擋在面前的一切阻礙。",[24],[274,504],{"id":988,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":989,"visible":15},"10003518",{"type":10,"entryId":990,"sortOrder":991,"name":992,"imageUrl":993,"description":994,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":283,"position":995,"attributes":996},"074",1028400,"晶背龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10284.png","攝取的晶礦在體內經過提煉，會化為蘊含精純能量的晶脊向外生長。",[24],[504],{"id":998,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":999,"visible":15},"10003393",{"type":10,"entryId":1000,"sortOrder":1001,"name":1002,"imageUrl":1003,"description":1004,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":1005,"attributes":1006},"075",1028500,"晶簇龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10285.png","棲息於晶礦充足之地，背部晶脊極其堅硬，不僅能保護身體，更是儲存能量的重要結構。",[24],[504],{"id":1008,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":1009,"visible":15},"10003386",{"type":10,"entryId":1010,"sortOrder":1011,"name":1012,"imageUrl":1013,"description":1014,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":1015,"attributes":1016},"076",1043100,"蟻煙囪","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10431.png","蟻煙囪用泥土一點一滴修築自己的外殼，遇險時會從頂部孔洞噴出煙霧籠罩四周，藉此遮掩身形。",[336],[504],{"id":1018,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":1019,"visible":15},"10003447",{"type":10,"entryId":1020,"sortOrder":1021,"name":1022,"imageUrl":1023,"description":1024,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":1025,"attributes":1026},"077",1043300,"蟻地堡","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10433.png","上下身體具備可獨立旋轉的結構，讓蟻地堡能靈活觀察四周，並伺機變形出砲台擊退對手。",[336],[504],{"id":1028,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":1029,"visible":15},"10003497",{"type":10,"entryId":1030,"sortOrder":1031,"name":1032,"imageUrl":1033,"description":1034,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":1035,"attributes":1036},"078",1014100,"燈泡水母","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10141.png","生性膽小，一有風吹草動便立刻逃走，頭頂燈泡狀器官會隨著健康狀況產生變化。",[336],[26],{"id":1038,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":1039,"visible":15},"10003479",{"type":10,"entryId":1040,"sortOrder":1041,"name":1042,"imageUrl":1043,"description":1044,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":283,"position":1045,"attributes":1046},"079",1014200,"燈紗水母","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10142.png","極度怕黑的水母，每當夜晚降臨便會開始發光，即便入睡也不熄滅，猶如一盞守夜明燈。",[336],[26],{"id":1048,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":1049,"visible":15},"10003388",{"type":10,"entryId":1050,"sortOrder":1051,"name":1052,"imageUrl":1053,"description":1054,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":1055,"attributes":1056},"080",1014300,"吊燈水母","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10143.png","能根據心情自如調節發光的亮度與頻率。觸手不僅能閃爍出炫麗獨特的光斑，還能傳導電流攻擊目標。",[336],[26],{"id":1058,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":1059,"visible":15},"10003429",{"type":10,"entryId":1060,"sortOrder":1061,"name":1062,"imageUrl":1063,"description":1064,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":1065,"attributes":1066},"081",1048100,"浴球鳥","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10481.png","揉搓體表油脂會產生大量泡沫，既能清潔又能保護自己，但有時也會踩到泡沫而滑倒。",[432],[401],{"id":1068,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":1069,"visible":15},"10003430",{"type":10,"entryId":1070,"sortOrder":1071,"name":1072,"imageUrl":1073,"description":1074,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":1075,"attributes":1076},"082",1048300,"沐羽鳥","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10483.png","羽毛會不斷分泌油脂，稍加揉搓就能產生各式各樣的泡泡，而用於保護背上幼鳥的，自然是其中最柔軟綿密的一種。",[432],[401],{"id":1078,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":1079,"visible":15},"10003549",{"type":10,"entryId":1080,"sortOrder":1081,"name":1082,"imageUrl":1083,"description":1084,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":241,"position":1085,"attributes":1086},"083",1012200,"貝瑟斯","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10122.png","深受心跳鼓點困擾的貝瑟斯，不斷尋找能掩蓋鼓聲的節奏，熱愛搖擺身體並追求前衛的音樂藝術。",[432],[26],{"id":1088,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":1089,"visible":15},"10003494",{"type":10,"entryId":1090,"sortOrder":1091,"name":1092,"imageUrl":1093,"description":1094,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":1095,"attributes":1096},"084",1038100,"珊殼魚","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10381.png","將身體埋入地底偽裝成珊瑚，一旦獵物靠近便會一口咬上。不過偶爾也會耐不住性子，露出眼睛四處張望。",[432],[504,401],{"id":1098,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":1099,"visible":15},"10003486",{"type":10,"entryId":1100,"sortOrder":1101,"name":1102,"imageUrl":1103,"description":1104,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":1105,"attributes":1106},"085",1038300,"珊瑚龍","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10383.png","喜歡將身體埋在沙子中擬態成珊瑚叢，利用頭背部珊瑚的夜光誘捕生物並伺機突襲。",[432],[504,401],{"id":1108,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":1109,"visible":15},"10003530",{"type":10,"entryId":1110,"sortOrder":1111,"name":1112,"imageUrl":1113,"description":1114,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":1115,"attributes":1116},"086",1046100,"海墩墩","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10461.png","腮幫子上的圓圈常被誤認為眼睛。喜歡成群結隊出現在海岸邊，與同伴擠在一起便會感到安心。",[24],[422],{"id":1118,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":1119,"visible":15},"10003457",{"type":10,"entryId":1120,"sortOrder":1121,"name":1122,"imageUrl":1123,"description":1124,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":1125,"attributes":1126},"087",1046300,"浪海象","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10463.png","用四肢在陸地移動時略顯笨拙，但極其擅長以肚皮滑行。同性間領地意識極強，一旦動怒便會展現海嘯般的威壓。",[24],[422],{"id":1128,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":1129,"visible":15},"10003423",{"type":10,"entryId":1130,"sortOrder":1131,"name":1132,"imageUrl":1133,"description":1134,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":1135,"attributes":1136},"088",1058100,"覓葉羊","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10581.png","懶洋洋地伸展葉羽，嘴裡總嚼個沒完，把綠藻和黏液變成飄飛的泡泡，輕輕一蹬，就能乘著泡泡悠悠出發。",[399],[379,401],{"id":1138,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":1139,"visible":15},"10003419",{"type":10,"entryId":1140,"sortOrder":1141,"name":1142,"imageUrl":1143,"description":1144,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":1145,"attributes":1146},"089",1058300,"麗芙羊","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10583.png","披著翠綠葉羽的麗芙羊體態輕盈，在湖岸邊悠哉漫步，特別喜歡清澈的水面，老是沉迷於水中倒影那優雅從容的模樣。",[399],[379,401],{"id":1148,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":1149,"visible":15},"10003410",{"type":10,"entryId":1150,"sortOrder":1151,"name":1152,"imageUrl":1153,"description":1154,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":1155,"attributes":1156},"090",1062100,"吐泡章魚","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10621.png","喜歡蒐集各種顏色的泡泡，氣囊裡的泡泡隨著身體動作起伏晃動，靈感一來，就會用繽紛的泡泡畫出奇妙的塗鴉。",[272],[401],{"id":1158,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":1159,"visible":15},"10003509",{"type":10,"entryId":1160,"sortOrder":1161,"name":1162,"imageUrl":1163,"description":1164,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":1165,"attributes":1166},"091",1062300,"扭蛋章魚","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10623.png","靈活的觸手可以刺激腦袋噴出不同的扭蛋泡泡，誰也不知道泡泡裡藏的是驚喜還是驚嚇。",[272],[401],{"id":1168,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":1169,"visible":15},"10003413",{"type":10,"entryId":1170,"sortOrder":1171,"name":1172,"imageUrl":1173,"description":1174,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":191,"position":1175,"attributes":1176},"092",1042100,"海神魔","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10421.png","以開朗笑容偽裝自己並悄悄接近目標，一旦進入戰鬥便會顯露真面目，露出蓄勢待發的尖牙。",[272],[422],{"id":1178,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":1179,"visible":15},"10003407",{"type":10,"entryId":1180,"sortOrder":1181,"name":1182,"imageUrl":1183,"description":1184,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":22,"position":1185,"attributes":1186},"093",1042300,"魔海蝶","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10423.png","柔軟身軀中藏著尖牙與利爪，最擅長以溫柔無害的模樣令其他生物掉以輕心，再隨手將其凍成冰雕。",[272],[422],{"id":1188,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":1189,"visible":15},"10003498",{"type":10,"entryId":1190,"sortOrder":1191,"name":1192,"imageUrl":1193,"description":1194,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":241,"position":1195,"attributes":1196},"9997",1037300,"朧月狐","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10373.png","毛髮上流動著柔和月光，外表看似有些難以親近。總是理性冷靜地看待問題，但在面對熟悉之人時，也會露出親暱的神情。",[272],[1197],"attributes-holy",{"id":1199,"viewCount":57,"searchKey":1200,"visible":15},"10003375",{"type":10,"entryId":1201,"sortOrder":1202,"name":1203,"imageUrl":1204,"description":1205,"currentMorphology":21,"currentStage":241,"position":1206,"attributes":1207},"9998",1036100,"日耀獅","/cdn/init/Wiki_Aniimo_10361.png","熱情活潑且自信滿滿，勇於保護同伴。關鍵時刻能覺醒強大力量，爆發出驚人的戰力。",[272],[1197],[1209,1216,1221,1226,1231,1236,1241,1246,1250,1253,1258,1263,1267,1272,1277,1282,1287,1292,1295],{"id":1210,"parentId":1211,"tagType":1212,"tagKey":9,"name":1213,"lang